    "from": "the published article (PDF), Tables 1 to 3, read from the text layer by position and checked cell by cell against the pages rendered at 130 dpi; the pH of the last three rows of Table 3 read on the page rendered at 260 dpi, where the text layer misplaces two footnote marks and drops one value",
    "checked_against_source": true,
    "note": "A value printed '<x' is kept as x with the qualifier 'below_detection_limit'; a bare '<' (below the detection limit, value not printed) is null with that qualifier. Table 3 prints three replicate pore solutions at 7 days, numbered by 'replicate'. Its DOC column prints the dissolved organic carbon and, in parentheses, the dissolved formate the authors estimate from the excess of positive charge (footnote a), transcribed as 'DOC' and 'formate' (qualifier 'estimated'); its OH- column is the free hydroxide calculated from the measured pH (footnote b), qualifier 'from_pH'. The Al of 1310 days is printed with an asterisk, 'outlier value?', qualifier 'outlier'."
